        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಪುರಾಣ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪುರಾಣ — purāṇa — \"a myth; an old legend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಮಲಗುವ ಮುಂಚೆ ಒಂದು ಪುರಾಣ ಕಥೆ ಹೇಳಿದರು. ajji malaguva muñce ondu purāṇa kathe hēḷidaru. Before bed Grandmother told an old legend."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಪುರಾಣಗಳು, purāṇagaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The old Sanskrit story collections are the ಪುರಾಣಗಳು. In talk, ಪುರಾಣ (purāṇa) can also be a long, boring tale."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪುರಾಣ (purāṇa) is borrowed from Sanskrit purāṇa, \"ancient, belonging to olden times\" (CDIAL 8283), then the name of collections of old tales."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
